# Feature Registry v1.8

Each turn, draw through 「Unit Map v1.1」. Do not open unused specs. After the match, apply `contradictions` and `forbids`. Append through 「Field Ledger v1.0」 when this turn produced a record. Append through 「Growth Map v1.0」 when a unit grew.

1. Read `.cursor/framework/map.json` only.
2. Match layer `when`, then unit `when`.
3. If a contradiction `when` matches, keep `prefer`, drop the other. If a forbid `when` matches, follow `rule`.
4. Read `.cursor/framework/ledger/index.json`. Open a log line only when its `when` matches.
5. Read `.cursor/framework/growth/index.json`. Open a growth log line only when its `unit` matches, or when the user asked how that unit grows.
6. Open remaining `spec`. Copy unit `line` when listing. Copy contradiction `line` only when Unit Map is the subject, or when that contradiction fired.
7. If this turn produced a fact, experiment, success, failure, or insight, append one ledger row. If a unit was born, bumped, locked, rejected, split, settled, or stored, append one growth row.
8. Close the rest.

「Settle Prompt v1.0」: draw when a reusable unregistered form appeared or was praised, and 定着 / 登録 was not already ordered.
If 定着 / 登録 / 固定 was already ordered, skip Settle Prompt and register.

「Voice Mark v1.2」: draw on user-facing Japanese. No bold. Underline, 「」, （）. Bullets for parallel items. Group by layer when listing many. Never 手段 / 目標 / 条件 / 理由 / 措置.

「Read Ease v1.1」: draw with Voice Mark on user-facing Japanese. Sourced rules in `.cursor/rules/read-ease.mdc`. Do not shorten locked lines. Do not flatten 熟語.

「Growth Map v1.0」: draw when a unit grew, or when the user asked how units grow. Map in `GROWTH.txt`. Detail in `growth/log.jsonl`. Do not dump the growth log into the catalog.

Locked voice when this Feature is the subject. Copy each `line` from the map.

